[{"text": "I now give the floor to his excellency", "start": 3.2, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "Vegeta Hira, Minister for Foreign", "start": 6.0, "duration": 6.599}, {"text": "Affairs of Sri Lanka.", "start": 8.639, "duration": 3.96}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 25.84, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "Mr. Mr. Secretary General, excellencies,", "start": 27.76, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "ladies and gentlemen, allow me at the", "start": 31.039, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "outset to congratulate you Dr. Khalilu", "start": 34.079, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "Rahman on your election as president of", "start": 36.88, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "the 81st session of the general", "start": 39.84, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "assembly.", "start": 42.32, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "On behalf of the government of Sri", "start": 44.079, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "Lanka, I wish you every success and", "start": 45.76, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "assure you of our fullest support in the", "start": 48.879, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "discharge of your mandate.", "start": 51.92, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "We also convey our deep appreciation to", "start": 55.36, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "your predecessor Madame Analina Bayok", "start": 58.079, "duration": 6.881}, {"text": "for her able stewardship of the 18th", "start": 61.68, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "session.", "start": 64.96, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "Let me also take this opportunity to", "start": 67.28, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "acknowledge the leadership of Secretary", "start": 69.92, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "General Antonio Gutares as he concludes", "start": 72.4, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "his term. Mr. President,", "start": 75.84, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "seinal changes are taking place across", "start": 79.68, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "the world at a pace faster than many", "start": 82.159, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "institutions are able to adapt or", "start": 84.96, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "respond.", "start": 87.6, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "People across the globe are demanding", "start": 89.68, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "greater clarity, honesty, and action", "start": 92.0, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "from their leaders and institutions.", "start": 94.96, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "The theme of this year's general debate,", "start": 99.2, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "restoring trust, managing", "start": 102.56, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "transformation, a united nations that", "start": 104.64, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "delivers for all, goes to the heart of", "start": 107.52, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "this challenge.", "start": 110.56, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "The erosion of trust is reflected in", "start": 112.72, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "unresolved conflicts, humanitarian", "start": 115.92, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "crisis that outpace available resources,", "start": 118.799, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "increasingly frequent climate disasters,", "start": 122.799, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "widening in inequalities and", "start": 126.719, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "technological advances that are moving", "start": 129.2, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "faster than governance.", "start": 132.0, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "Together, these developments have", "start": 134.879, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "contributed to a growing perception that", "start": 137.44, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "global institutions are distant from the", "start": 140.64, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "people they are mean to resolve.", "start": 144.239, "duration": 7.201}, {"text": "Sri Lanka understands this reality", "start": 148.72, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "deeply.", "start": 151.44, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "My country has on many occasions in the", "start": 153.36, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "past experienced the consequences of", "start": 157.04, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "deficits in trust and breaches of the", "start": 160.48, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "social contract.", "start": 163.36, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "Two years ago,", "start": 165.76, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "marking a watershed moment in our", "start": 167.84, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "history, the people of Sri Lanka", "start": 170.08, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "representing all communities and walks", "start": 173.28, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "of life gave a resounding mandate to the", "start": 175.68, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "government of President Andrakumar", "start": 179.04, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "Rajisanaka to address these challenges", "start": 181.28, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "and institute meaningful change.", "start": 184.4, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "Since then,", "start": 188.319, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "our government has been working with", "start": 190.159, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "determination to rebuild trust from the", "start": 192.319, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "ground up.", "start": 195.28, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "We are building trust through action,", "start": 197.44, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "not rhetoric, through delivery,", "start": 200.239, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "discipline and the courage to confront", "start": 203.92, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "wrongdoing.", "start": 206.56, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "Sri Lanka too is therefore undergoing a", "start": 208.4, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "historic transformation transformation", "start": 212.879, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "and rejuvenation.", "start": 215.599, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "Despite conflicts in several parts of", "start": 218.879, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "the world in including in West Asia and", "start": 221.519, "duration": 7.201}, {"text": "climate calamities including the cyclone", "start": 225.92, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "that struck Sri Lanka, my country has", "start": 228.72, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "restored macroeconomic stability", "start": 232.0, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "following the economic crisis of 2022.", "start": 234.799, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "Today", "start": 239.04, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "Sri Lanka has been reclassified by the", "start": 240.64, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "World Bank as an upper middle income", "start": 243.439, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "economy and ratings agencies have", "start": 245.92, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "recognized this positive trajectory.", "start": 249.28, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "However,", "start": 253.92, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "these developments do not fully reflect", "start": 255.92, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "the vulnerabilities of countries exposed", "start": 258.32, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "to debt and external socks.", "start": 261.199, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "While we work with our global partners", "start": 264.479, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "to consolidate this hard one stability,", "start": 267.04, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "we remain conscious of the critical need", "start": 270.72, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "to address the hardships faced by", "start": 273.52, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "vulnerable communities.", "start": 275.68, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "Cyclone Ditto was one of the worst", "start": 279.04, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "natural disasters in Sri Lanka's recent", "start": 281.759, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "history and devastated several parts of", "start": 284.479, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "our country.", "start": 287.199, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "The calamity resulted in the loss of", "start": 289.44, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "hundreds of lives and affected more than", "start": 291.919, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "two million people.", "start": 295.12, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "Livelihoods were disrupted and critical", "start": 297.36, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "infrastructure", "start": 300.4, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "was destroyed.", "start": 302.24, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "Having experienced this tragedy,", "start": 305.199, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "we understand deeply the challenge posed", "start": 308.24, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "by the Himalayan floods to the people of", "start": 310.8, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "Nepal and China.", "start": 313.44, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "We extend our deepest sympathies to the", "start": 315.759, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "victims.", "start": 319.039, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "These tragic events demonstrate the", "start": 321.68, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "enormous human and economic cost of", "start": 323.919, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "climate change.", "start": 326.24, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "Sadly, its harshest consequences", "start": 328.32, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "continue to be borne by countries that", "start": 332.08, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "have contributed least to global", "start": 334.4, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "emissions.", "start": 336.56, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "The call for action on climate impact is", "start": 338.72, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "not merely immediate.", "start": 341.36, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "It is overdue.", "start": 343.6, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "Climate justice must become an urgent", "start": 346.0, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "reality.", "start": 348.479, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "For our part, Sri Lanka is on track", "start": 350.8, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "towards achieving 70%", "start": 353.6, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "renewable energy by 2030 and carbon", "start": 356.72, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "utility by 2050.", "start": 359.6, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 362.56, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "for three decades, Sri Lanka suffered a", "start": 364.88, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "protracted conflict that caused enormous", "start": 368.0, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "loss and suffering to all our", "start": 370.8, "duration": 3.839}, {"text": "communities.", "start": 372.72, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "Although the guns fell silent 17 years", "start": 374.639, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "ago, the deep wounds of that conflict", "start": 378.16, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "remain and much remains to be done to", "start": 381.12, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "heal them.", "start": 383.84, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "We are determined to prevent a", "start": 386.0, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "recurrence of such a tragedy and to", "start": 388.8, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "pursue a path towards national unity and", "start": 391.12, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "reconciliation.", "start": 394.08, "duration": 5.119}, {"text": "In this regard, our government is", "start": 396.319, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "strengthening national institutions to", "start": 399.199, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "address outstanding issues.", "start": 402.0, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "Throughout these two years, we have", "start": 405.12, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "remained firm in our rejection of racism", "start": 407.84, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "and religious extremism in all its forms", "start": 411.199, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "and manifestations.", "start": 414.319, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "We will continue to work tirelessly to", "start": 416.88, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "build a nation that is more secure,", "start": 419.44, "duration": 7.599}, {"text": "inclusive, and united. A nation made", "start": 423.44, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "stronger by the full richness of its", "start": 427.039, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "diversity.", "start": 429.52, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 431.36, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "in addition to the consequences of", "start": 433.599, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "natural calamity, Sri Lanka, like many", "start": 435.84, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "other countries, is experiencing the", "start": 438.72, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "severe impact of conflicts in West Asia", "start": 441.84, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "and elsewhere.", "start": 444.4, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "As an island nation situated at the", "start": 446.8, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "crossroads of the Indian Ocean and as a", "start": 449.68, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "country with a large number of migrant", "start": 452.8, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "workers in West Asia, these developments", "start": 455.039, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "have direct security, economic and", "start": 458.16, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "social implications for us.", "start": 460.479, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "I am pleased to note that even during", "start": 463.599, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "these challenging times, Sri Lanka has", "start": 466.56, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "continued to uphold its commitments to", "start": 469.039, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "international law and ensure sanctity of", "start": 471.68, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "human life and human dignity.", "start": 474.879, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "Mr. President", "start": 478.24, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "in March this year amidst a highly", "start": 480.4, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "volatile geopolitical landscape Sri", "start": 484.08, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "Lanka found a ship of a party to a", "start": 486.72, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "conflict in distress close to our", "start": 489.599, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "territorial waters with many sailors", "start": 491.919, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "life in Perin.", "start": 494.479, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "We took the difficult path of navigating", "start": 496.639, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "a wilderness of sensitivities and", "start": 499.52, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "marshalling our limited nations", "start": 503.919, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "resources to rescue and look after the", "start": 505.84, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "wounded and sick.", "start": 508.319, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "Hard as it was, we went on to rescue", "start": 510.56, "duration": 7.359}, {"text": "hundreds more. We saw human lives in", "start": 514.08, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "danger and we acted founding ourselves", "start": 517.919, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "on international law and on humanity.", "start": 521.44, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "While safeguarding our neutrality, we", "start": 525.519, "duration": 7.601}, {"text": "placed humanity above all else.", "start": 528.8, "duration": 8.8}, {"text": "As President Danaka has reiterated,", "start": 533.12, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "we will never hesitate to protect", "start": 537.6, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "humanity.", "start": 539.44, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "If there are actions that must be taken", "start": 541.12, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "to protect human lives, we will not", "start": 543.76, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "hesitate to take them under any", "start": 546.959, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "circumstance.", "start": 549.2, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "This, Mr. President is the Sri Lanka we", "start": 551.68, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "wish to bring before the world. A small", "start": 555.6, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "island nation with a big heart which", "start": 558.24, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "believes that even in times of conflict", "start": 561.279, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "and profound division there remains", "start": 564.399, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "space for humanity", "start": 567.279, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "and that is also what we wish to see", "start": 570.32, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "reflected in the world.", "start": 572.88, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "We need a world where our capacity to", "start": 575.6, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "uphold humanity grows faster than our", "start": 578.88, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "capacity to destroy it. That is the", "start": 581.839, "duration": 7.041}, {"text": "transformation we should seek.", "start": 585.44, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "It is for these reasons that we are", "start": 588.88, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "pained by the developments in Gaza and", "start": 591.839, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "the occupied Palestinian territories.", "start": 594.8, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 598.16, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "the global security environment has", "start": 600.56, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "deteriorated significantly in recent", "start": 602.8, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "years.", "start": 605.44, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "It is difficult to accept that in a", "start": 607.12, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "world with so much wealth and knowledge.", "start": 610.0, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "Vast resources continue to be spent on", "start": 612.959, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "weapons while children face starvation", "start": 615.6, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "and are deprived of medicine and", "start": 619.12, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "education.", "start": 621.36, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "Sri Lanka remains deeply concerned by", "start": 623.2, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "the conflicts in West Asia and by the", "start": 625.519, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "heavy cost being born far beyond the", "start": 628.48, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "region.", "start": 631.04, "duration": 3.919}, {"text": "International law including", "start": 633.04, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "international humanitarian law must be", "start": 634.959, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "adhered to and respected by all parties.", "start": 637.36, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "We reaffirm our position that dialogue", "start": 641.279, "duration": 6.961}, {"text": "is the only viable way forward.", "start": 644.24, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "Sri Lanka continues to support the", "start": 648.24, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "inalienable rights of the Palestinian", "start": 650.48, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "people,", "start": 653.12, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "including their rights to", "start": 654.959, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "self-determination.", "start": 656.88, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "We are among the countries that first", "start": 658.959, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "recognized Palestine as a distinct state", "start": 661.279, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "in in the 1980s.", "start": 664.079, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "We stand in solidarity with the", "start": 667.2, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "international community in calling for", "start": 669.36, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "an independent and sovereign state of", "start": 671.44, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "Palestine existing side by side with", "start": 673.839, "duration": 8.641}, {"text": "Israel in peace within the pre96867", "start": 676.72, "duration": 8.4}, {"text": "borders.", "start": 682.48, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "We welcome the resolution of the", "start": 685.12, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "security council on ceasefire in Gaza", "start": 687.04, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "and urge all parties to uphold it.", "start": 690.0, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "Humanitarian assistance must reach", "start": 693.76, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "civilians without obstruction.", "start": 696.56, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "The recovery and reconstruction of Gaza", "start": 699.44, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "must be an urgent priority.", "start": 702.16, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "Mr. President", "start": 705.6, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "Sri Lanka is proud of its long-standing", "start": 708.079, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "contribution to United Nations", "start": 710.24, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "peacekeeping in pursuit of global peace", "start": 711.839, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "and security having de deployed more", "start": 714.88, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "than 21,000 personnel on numerous", "start": 717.68, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "missions since 1957.", "start": 720.8, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "Our blue helmets through their", "start": 724.0, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "dedication and service over many years", "start": 727.36, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "have earned the trust of local", "start": 730.72, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "communities and the commendation of UN", "start": 732.72, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "field mission.", "start": 735.92, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Today they continue to serve with", "start": 738.079, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "distinction in some of the most", "start": 741.04, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "challenging environments under the UN", "start": 742.88, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "flag. protecting vulnerable civilians,", "start": 744.72, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "deterring violence and helping vote on", "start": 748.8, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "communities transition from conflict to", "start": 752.16, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "stability.", "start": 754.8, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "Sri Lanka has also long championed", "start": 757.36, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "multilateral disarmament from our early", "start": 759.76, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "call for an Indian o Indian oen zone of", "start": 762.8, "duration": 8.96}, {"text": "peace to our leadership at the 1995", "start": 766.88, "duration": 9.759}, {"text": "NPT review and extension conference.", "start": 771.76, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "At a time of rising geopolitical", "start": 776.639, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "tensions and rhetoric of nuclear", "start": 778.639, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "escalation, we remain firmly convinced", "start": 781.04, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "that the only real guarantee against", "start": 784.56, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "these weapons is their total and", "start": 787.2, "duration": 5.439}, {"text": "verifiable elimination.", "start": 789.839, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 792.639, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "as we approach 2030, we must deliver on", "start": 794.88, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "the sustainable development goals which", "start": 798.88, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "remain our collective blueprint for", "start": 801.6, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "sustainable development.", "start": 803.92, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "Sri Lanka once again calls for reform of", "start": 806.639, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "the international financial system and", "start": 809.12, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "for fair rules governing debt and", "start": 811.36, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "development finance.", "start": 813.92, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "We welcomed the civil commitment last", "start": 816.32, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "year, including its call for urgent", "start": 818.959, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "action to close the $4 trillion", "start": 822.16, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "financing gap for sustainable", "start": 824.959, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "development in developing countries.", "start": 826.72, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "It is now time to translate those", "start": 830.0, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "commitments into concrete action.", "start": 832.48, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "We remain steadfast in recognizing", "start": 836.639, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "poverty and inequality as factors", "start": 839.44, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "requiring our urgent attention.", "start": 842.24, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "Our national budget last year made", "start": 845.36, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "historic allocations to the healthcare", "start": 848.079, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "and education sectors. We take pride in", "start": 850.079, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "our long-standing policy of free and", "start": 853.68, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "universal healthcare and education", "start": 855.6, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "and remain committed to strengthening", "start": 858.8, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "these important pillars of social", "start": 861.44, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "justice.", "start": 863.36, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "While actively implementing all SDGs", "start": 865.92, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "without discrimination,", "start": 868.8, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "we fully subscribe to and proactively", "start": 870.959, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "engage with SDG16,", "start": 873.92, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "which underscores the importance of just", "start": 876.399, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "and inclusive institutions that build", "start": 878.959, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "and restore public trust and treat all", "start": 882.0, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "people equally.", "start": 885.04, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "Mr. President", "start": 887.36, "duration": 3.919}, {"text": "Sri Lanka has long championed and", "start": 889.36, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "contributed towards a fair and peaceful", "start": 891.279, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "order at sea under the United Nations", "start": 893.839, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Convention on the Law of the Sea, a", "start": 896.48, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "legal regime which we have helped shape.", "start": 898.959, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "We also support the work of the", "start": 902.959, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "Commission on the Limits of the", "start": 905.279, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "continental shelf. We remain committed", "start": 907.12, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "to preserving the oceans as a shared", "start": 910.16, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "space for peaceful and sustainable use", "start": 913.519, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "and for international cooperation.", "start": 916.56, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "Our nation's prosperity is closely", "start": 920.079, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "linked to the Indian Ocean.", "start": 922.8, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "As founding member of the agreement on", "start": 926.399, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "marine biological diversity of areas", "start": 929.199, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "beyond nation jurisdiction, the BBNJ", "start": 932.16, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "agreement, we reaffirm our commitment to", "start": 935.36, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "safeguarding the oceans as a common", "start": 939.04, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "heritage of humankind for present and", "start": 941.68, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "future generations.", "start": 944.48, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "We look forward to the further", "start": 946.72, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "operationalization of the agreement", "start": 949.68, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "complementing", "start": 952.72, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "the processes of the international", "start": 955.04, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "seabed authority.", "start": 957.519, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 960.16, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "one of the key pillars of the decisive", "start": 962.48, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "mandate given to us by the people of Sri", "start": 964.88, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "Lanka was to build a transparent and", "start": 967.199, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "ethical nation.", "start": 970.16, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "In delivering on this mandate, we have", "start": 972.32, "duration": 6.079}, {"text": "placed good governance, anti-corruption", "start": 975.519, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "and institutional transparency at the", "start": 978.399, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "core of a comprehensive national", "start": 981.519, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "integrity drive that is being vigorously", "start": 984.079, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "pursued.", "start": 987.279, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "We have seen all too clearly how", "start": 989.279, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "corruption weakens democracy and", "start": 991.519, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "destroys trust.", "start": 993.519, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "We continue to enforce the law against", "start": 996.16, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "corruption without fear or favor,", "start": 998.48, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "irrespective of a person's background or", "start": 1001.04, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "social standing.", "start": 1003.36, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "Investigations and prosecutions continue", "start": 1005.6, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "to progress without political", "start": 1008.16, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "interference.", "start": 1010.079, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "Substantial progress has been made in", "start": 1012.56, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "strengthening the independence of in", "start": 1014.88, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "institutions responsible for", "start": 1017.279, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "investigating and prosecuting bribery", "start": 1019.36, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "and corruption.", "start": 1021.759, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "My president who addressed this assembly", "start": 1023.68, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "last year also highlighted how narcotics", "start": 1026.319, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "and related organized crime have become", "start": 1030.16, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "a menace for many countries as well as", "start": 1032.64, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "our government's comprehensive efforts", "start": 1035.6, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "to address this menace.", "start": 1038.0, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "One year on our united as a nation", "start": 1041.199, "duration": 5.921}, {"text": "anti-narotic", "start": 1045.52, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "national program has made significant", "start": 1047.12, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "progress including through the rest ar", "start": 1050.16, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "rest rest of key figures in the", "start": 1054.16, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "narcotics supply chain.", "start": 1055.679, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 1058.799, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "we reiterate our call on the global", "start": 1061.039, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "community to promote meaningful", "start": 1063.44, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "technology transfers, ensure equitable", "start": 1065.12, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "access for developing nations, bridge", "start": 1068.64, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "the digital divide and build safe,", "start": 1071.2, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "secure and trust trustworthy systems", "start": 1074.88, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "that leave no one behind.", "start": 1077.44, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "Sri Lanka is in the process of building", "start": 1080.559, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "digital future that includes everyone.", "start": 1083.36, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "We have developed national AI ethical", "start": 1086.96, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "guidelines in line with international", "start": 1090.16, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "frameworks.", "start": 1092.48, "duration": 4.559}, {"text": "We must ensure that emerging", "start": 1094.32, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "technologies and artificial intelligence", "start": 1097.039, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "are developed and used responsibly and", "start": 1099.6, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "consistently with international law", "start": 1102.88, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "including the wellestablished principles", "start": 1105.52, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "of international humanitarian law. Their", "start": 1107.84, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "development and use must contribute to", "start": 1111.6, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "international peace and security while", "start": 1114.24, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "advancing humanity's collective", "start": 1116.4, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "interests.", "start": 1118.72, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "The interest of humanity must always", "start": 1121.039, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "guide the development and use of these", "start": 1123.44, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "technologies.", "start": 1125.76, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 1127.52, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "for Sri Lanka, the United Nations is an", "start": 1129.84, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "indispensable partner. The UN has stood", "start": 1133.12, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "with us in challenging times and", "start": 1136.48, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "supported our development.", "start": 1138.72, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "For many of us in the developing world,", "start": 1141.6, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "the United Nation is also an expression", "start": 1145.039, "duration": 6.161}, {"text": "of a fundamental promise that every", "start": 1148.48, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "nation la large or small has a voice.", "start": 1151.2, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "That every people has a right to dignity", "start": 1155.76, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "and development", "start": 1158.08, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "and that in an interdependent world no", "start": 1159.84, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "country should be left to confront", "start": 1164.08, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "global challenges alone.", "start": 1166.48, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "For more than eight decades,", "start": 1170.0, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "amidst its flaws and with much room for", "start": 1172.48, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "improvement, the United Nations has", "start": 1175.039, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "given practical meaning to that promise.", "start": 1177.76, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "However, genuine faith in", "start": 1181.28, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "multilateralism requires the courage to", "start": 1184.08, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "acknowledge where the system has fallen", "start": 1186.799, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "short, the humility to listen to those", "start": 1189.12, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "who feel unheard and the determination", "start": 1192.32, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "to make our institutions more effective,", "start": 1195.12, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "more repres representative and more", "start": 1198.559, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "responsive.", "start": 1201.2, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "In this regard, Sri Lanka supports the", "start": 1203.52, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "UN8 initiative as an opportunity to", "start": 1206.48, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "renew and strengthen the United Nations", "start": 1209.76, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "and advance advance meaningful reform.", "start": 1212.32, "duration": 7.44}, {"text": "Mr. President, managing transformation", "start": 1216.72, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "cannot mean managing change for some", "start": 1219.76, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "while asking others merely to adapt to", "start": 1222.559, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "its consequences.", "start": 1224.96, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "The transformation taking place in our", "start": 1227.52, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "world must be inclusive.", "start": 1229.919, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "It must narrow rather than deepen the", "start": 1232.96, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "divides between north and south, between", "start": 1236.48, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "those who save new technologies and", "start": 1239.28, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "those who merely receive them and", "start": 1242.159, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "between those who possesses resilience", "start": 1244.559, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "and those who are most exposed to global", "start": 1247.2, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "shocks.", "start": 1249.6, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "My country comes to this assembly not", "start": 1251.6, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "with the expectation that the United", "start": 1254.48, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "Nations can solve every problem but with", "start": 1257.12, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "the conviction that there are problems", "start": 1260.4, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "which no country can solve alone. Our", "start": 1262.88, "duration": 7.279}, {"text": "answer must therefore be a renewed faith", "start": 1266.96, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "in multilateralism", "start": 1270.159, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "and a united nations that listens more", "start": 1272.64, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "closely, represents more fairly and", "start": 1275.919, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "delivers for all. I thank you, Mr.", "start": 1279.28, "duration": 5.639}, {"text": "President.", "start": 1281.919, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "I thank the Minister for Foreign Affairs", "start": 1289.679, "duration": 5.561}, {"text": "of Sri Lanka.", "start": 1291.76, "duration": 3.48}]